      "writtenOn": "2023-10-26T08:07:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s add this to draw attention to the constructor :\n\n    In particular, the constructor does not run on the handler thread, so it\n    must not touch any of the non-final fields, nor must it mutate any\n    of the non-final fields inside these objects.",
